{{!
    @template format_aicourse/icon_picker

    The section card icon picker modal. Rendered once per course page for editing teachers and
    hidden until the icon button on a section card opens it.

    It is an ARIA dialog: role="dialog" aria-modal="true" and aria-labelledby pointing at its own
    <h2>. Opening, closing, the focus trap, Escape and focus restoration are provided by
    format_aicourse/courseformat, which registers the modal with its shared dialog helper. Every
    SVG in here is decorative and therefore carries aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"; the
    accessible name of each icon button is its visible label.

    Classes required for JS:
    * aicourse-icon-picker-modal - the modal root; shown/hidden by format_aicourse/courseformat.
    * aicourse-icon-picker-backdrop - click target that closes the modal.
    * aicourse-icon-picker-content - the element the dialog role and focus trap are applied to.
    * aicourse-icon-picker-close - closes the modal.
    * aicourse-icon-search-input - the live search field.
    * aicourse-icon-picker-category - a category group; hidden when its icons are all filtered out.
    * aicourse-icon-picker-item - a selectable icon; also the roving keyboard-navigation target.
    * aicourse-icon-picker-label - the visible label, matched against the search term.
    * aicourse-icon-remove-btn - the "remove the icon from this section" item.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-category - the untranslated category slug the search filter compares against. The
      pseudo-category "__remove__" holds the Remove option.
    * data-icon - the icon key saved against the section, or "__clear__" to remove the icon.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * closelabel string Accessible name of the close button.
    * searchlabel string Label and placeholder of the search field.
    * removelabel string Label of the "remove icon" option.
    * categories array Icon categories, in display order.
        * key string Untranslated category slug, emitted as data-category.
        * label string Localised category heading.
        * icons array The icons in this category.
            * key string Icon key, emitted as data-icon.
            * label string Localised icon label.
            * svg string PRE-ESCAPED SVG child markup from
              \format_aicourse\local\icons::get_library(). This is plugin-defined constant markup,
              never user input, so it is rendered with a triple mustache.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "closelabel": "Close",
        "searchlabel": "Search icons…",
        "removelabel": "Remove icon",
        "categories": [
            {
                "key": "numbers",
                "label": "Numbers",
                "icons": [
                    {
                        "key": "num-1",
                        "label": "1",
                        "svg": "<text x=\"12\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">1</text>"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "key": "achievement",
                "label": "Achievement",
                "icons": [
                    {
                        "key": "star",
                        "label": "Star",
                        "svg": "<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/>"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="aicourse-icon-picker-modal" id="aicourse-icon-picker" style="display:none;" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="aicourse-icon-picker-title">
<div class="aicourse-icon-picker-backdrop"></div>
<div class="aicourse-icon-picker-content">
<div class="aicourse-icon-picker-header">
<h2 id="aicourse-icon-picker-title">{{#str}} selecticon, format_aicourse {{/str}}</h2>
<button type="button" class="aicourse-icon-picker-close" aria-label="{{closelabel}}"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
</div>
<div class="aicourse-icon-picker-search">
<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="aicourse-icon-search-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
<label class="accesshide" for="aicourse-icon-search">{{searchlabel}}</label>
<input type="text" id="aicourse-icon-search" class="aicourse-icon-search-input" placeholder="{{searchlabel}}" autocomplete="off" />
</div>
<div class="aicourse-icon-picker-body">
<div class="aicourse-icon-picker-category" data-category="__remove__">
<div class="aicourse-icon-picker-grid aicourse-icon-picker-grid--remove">
<button type="button" class="aicourse-icon-picker-item aicourse-icon-remove-btn" data-icon="__clear__" title="{{removelabel}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg><span class="aicourse-icon-picker-label">{{removelabel}}</span></button>
</div>
</div>
{{#categories}}
<div class="aicourse-icon-picker-category" data-category="{{key}}">
<div class="aicourse-icon-picker-category-label">{{label}}</div>
<div class="aicourse-icon-picker-grid">
{{#icons}}
<button type="button" class="aicourse-icon-picker-item" data-icon="{{key}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24">{{{svg}}}</svg><span class="aicourse-icon-picker-label">{{label}}</span></button>
{{/icons}}
</div>
</div>
{{/categories}}
</div>
</div>
</div>
